				<p class="fb-group-meta">Private Group • ~15 Posts/Day</p>
				<p class="fb-group-desc">
					A patient-centered group focusing on diet elimination trials, nerve pain management, and sharing personal recovery updates.
				</p>
				<a 
					href="https://www.facebook.com/groups/676992918980207" 
					target="_blank" 
					rel="noopener noreferrer" 
					class="fb-join-btn"
				>
					<span>Join Group &rarr;</span>
				</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>

